\newlabel{fig:apd}{{7}{15}{APD validation. A: Responsivity vs wavelength ($R = \eta e\lambda /hc$, Kasap Eq.~4.19). B: Signal current ($I_{\text {sig}} = M R P$, Kasap Eq.~4.23). C: RMS noise vs bandwidth (shot + thermal, Kasap Eqs.~4.42--4.46). D: Thermal noise floor ($\sqrt {4k_B T B/R_L}$, Johnson--Nyquist). E: Photon detection ($\bar {n} = Pt\eta /h\nu $, Saleh and Teich Eq.~17.1-10)}{figure.caption.14}{}}
